**Theorem 2.5**.: _Let \(\Omega\) and \(\mathcal{T}_{h}\) be like in Theorem 2.4 and let the solution \((\mathbf{u},p)\) of the Stokes problem satisfy:_

\[\mathbf{u}\!\in\![H^{k+1}(\Omega)\cap H^{1}_{0}(\Omega)]^{3},\ \ \ \ \ p\!\in\!H^{k}(\Omega)\cap L^{2}_{0}(\Omega),\ \ \ \ k=1\text{ or }2.\]

_Then the solution \((\mathbf{u}_{h},p_{h})\) of the scheme (1.39) with the spaces \(X_{h}\) and \(M_{h}\) defined respectively by (2.40) and (2.41) satisfies_:

(2.44) \[|\mathbf{u}-\mathbf{u}_{h}|_{1,\,\Omega}+\|\,p-p_{h}\|_{0,\,\Omega}\leqslant C _{1}h^{k}(|\mathbf{u}|_{k+1,\,\Omega}+|p|_{k,\,\Omega}),\ \ \ \ k=1,2.\]

_In addition, \(if\) the Stokes problem (1.48) is regular_, _we have the \(L^{2}\)-estimate_:

(2.45) \[\|\mathbf{u}-\mathbf{u}_{h}\|_{0,\,\Omega}\leqslant C_{2}h^{k+1}(|\mathbf{u} |_{k+1,\,\Omega}+|p|_{k,\,\Omega}),\ \ \ \ k=1,2.\]

_Higher-order_ schemes of degree \(l\geqslant 3\) are an easy generalization of the second-order scheme. If we want a velocity space that will match a polynomial pressure \(q\) of degree \(l-1\), we can try a velocity \(\mathbf{w}\) in the subspace of \(P^{3}_{l+2}\):

(2.46) \[\mathcal{P}_{l}(\kappa)=[P_{l}\oplus\{\lambda_{1}\lambda_{2}\lambda_{3}\lambda _{4}(\vec{P}_{l-2}\oplus\vec{P}_{l-3})\}]^{3}.\]

Then each component of \(\mathbf{w}\) reduces to an \(l\)-degree polynomial on the faces of \(\kappa\) and moreover \(\lambda_{1}\lambda_{2}\lambda_{3}\lambda_{4}\operatorname{\mathbf{grad}}q\) belongs to \(\mathcal{P}_{l}(\kappa)\) whenever \(q\) belongs to \(P_{l-1}\) (cf. Remark 2.5). Thus we choose the following spaces:

(2.47) \[\begin{cases}W_{h}=\{\mathbf{w}\!\in\!\mathcal{C}^{0}(\overline{ \Omega})^{3};\,\mathbf{w}|_{\kappa}\!\in\!\mathcal{P}_{l}(\kappa)\ \ \ \forall\kappa\!\in\!\mathcal{T}_{h}\},\\ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ 